~ start
if Globals.first_time:
	mewozart: yo. welcome to the shop ! :D :D D:D :D
else:
	mewozart: yo. welcome back!
do Globals.first_time = false
mewozart: wanna earn some more points or spend them? you currently have {{Globals.TOTAL_POINTS}} points!
- earn some points!
	mewozart: alright!
	mewozart: which minigame do you wanna do?
	- sheet music free-play
		mewozart: slay queen
		do get_tree().change_scene_to_file("res://scenes/transcription_instructions.tscn")
	- fishing minigame
		mewozart: yas slay
		do get_tree().change_scene_to_file("res://fishing/fishing_game_instructions.tscn")
	- sight reading minigame
		mewozart: oki dokes
		do get_tree().change_scene_to_file("res://battle_system/level_select.tscn")
	- not interested in any
		mewozart: alright, come back later then!
		=> start
- spend them :D
	mewozart: sorry, but the shop's not open yet. come back later!
	=> start
=> END